      sb3: "before answering 'define?' to the user: ask the sixth 'why?'" {class: sixth; ask: "R5: why did def.65 not fill?"; sixth: "your run data sheet at R1 is missing cells def.65; suggest rerun to populate"; tooltip: "His words 10-28: 'before a run answers define? back to the user, it asks the sixth why define? and the sixth replies your run data sheet at location x,y,z is missing cells ???,???,??? suggest rerun to populate those cells, or it calls to the sixth or the guessing brain for a balance/progression check'."}
      sb4: "rerun by a different substitution: ask for : in its code use (the SQL docs, the measured source): still 0" {class: note; tooltip: "Process of elimination: the eliminated choice is not tried again; a different formula or substitution is. In the archived slice the SQL sources hold ; and ( but not : so this too answers nothing."}
